	(descr "ANYSOLAR SM531K10TF solar cell 89 x 65 mm, four back contacts. Source: ANYSOLAR SM531K10TF datasheet (May 2021), p.3, Package front-side and back-side view. Contacts 3.0 dia, 22.3 from each side, 3.0 from top and bottom (bottom row per SM531K10L drawing). Back view mirrored to top view: pads 1/2 are the +/- of one half, 3/4 of the other. Cell land: plated hole the size of the cell's 3.0 mm contact, soldered from the board's back through the hole; 5.0 mm pad as flown on the XY and 2U faces")
